    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt þonne his þæt ic wille, þæt ælc mann sy under borge ge binnan burgum ge buton burgum.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">My will is, further, that every man be under surety, whether he live within a borough or in the country.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðæt is þonne, þæt ic wille, þæt ælc mon sy under borge ge binnan burgum ge buton burgum.</ab>
      </div>
